content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Planning": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Customization Request",
        "Vehicle",
        "Modification",
        "Customization Plan",
        "Customization Task",
        "Budget"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "objects": [
        "Quality Inspector",
        "Modification Review",
        "Completion Approval"
      ]
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "objects": [
        "Parts Manager",
        "Part Depletion Report",
        "Inventory",
        "Part",
        "Part Order"
      ]
    },
    "Modification": {
      "objects": [
        "Customization Specialist",
        "Customization Plan",
        "Work Order",
        "Technician",
        "Customization Task"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person requesting and approving vehicle customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Request",
      "description": "Description of the customer’s desired vehicle modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Customer’s vehicle that will be customized"
    },
    {
      "name": "Modification",
      "description": "Specific change or enhancement requested for the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Plan",
      "description": "Proposed design including tasks and budget for customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Task",
      "description": "Action performed to modify the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget",
      "description": "Estimated cost for the planned customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Specialist",
      "description": "Expert designing the customization and preparing work orders"
    },
    {
      "name": "Work Order",
      "description": "Document assigning tasks to technicians"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technician",
      "description": "Person performing the customization tasks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part Depletion Report",
      "description": "Notice that needed parts are missing or running low"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parts Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for inventory and part orders"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "Collection of available parts for customization work"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part",
      "description": "Component needed for vehicle modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part Order",
      "description": "Request for new parts to restock inventory"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Inspector",
      "description": "Person checking the correctness and safety of modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Modification Review",
      "description": "Inspection of finished modifications on the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completion Approval",
      "description": "Final confirmation that the work order is complete"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Planning": {
      "derived from": "Planning Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Customization Request",
        "Vehicle",
        "Modification",
        "Customization Proposal",
        "Planned Task",
        "Budget"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Customization Plan -> Customization Proposal",
        "Customization Task -> Planned Task"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "derived from": "Inspection Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Quality Inspector",
        "Modification Review",
        "Completion Approval"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Inventory Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Parts Manager",
        "Part Depletion Report",
        "Inventory",
        "Part",
        "Part Order"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Modification": {
      "derived from": "Modification Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customization Specialist",
        "Customization Plan",
        "Work Order",
        "Technician",
        "Customization Task"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
